 sell one as done, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who is coming to the curling fair, please?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out how much food to bring along, so for the curling fair, who is actually coming?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0015\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when the curling fair is, please?\"], [\"curling fair, when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Things have got a bit hectic this end and I need some breathing room, so could you bump the Ryota one a day later for me?\"], [\"can u push the Ryota thing a day later pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I was clearing out a load of old files the other night and now I'm second-guessing myself — did I bin the dormer document by accident?\"], [\"Could you check whether I deleted the dormer document, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0019\", \"v\": [[\"I think I deleted something I still need when I was tidying up earlier — could you bring the cobbler task back from the bin?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to settle up with everyone this week, so can you show me the kabaddi fund expenses over 30 rand?\", \"Hmm, one of those I can't quite remember the price of — how much was the shithum one?\", \"And the lessons one, I'm not sure where I filed it — which group is that in?\"], [\"can u get the cobbler task back out of the bin\", \"also kabaddi fund expenses over 30 rand?\", \"how much was the shithum one\", \"the lessons one, what group's it in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0020\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what day the joiner is on, please?\", \"Thank you. Who is coming to it?\", \"Could you tell me which events they're coming to, please?\", \"And what about the postcard?\"], [\"I need to be home when they turn up and I've completely lost track, so what day is the joiner on?\", \"Right, and I want to make sure someone's there to let them in — who's coming to it?\", \"I've a feeling I'll be seeing them more than once, so what other events are they coming to?\", \"Ok and while I'm at it, same question for the postcard — and the postcard?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0021\", \"v\": [[\"twenty rand on wine, Vyrness trip\", \"Bylford stuff?\", \"password on it?\"], [\"umm so I paid twenty rand for wine, can you put that in the, uh, Vyrness trip?\", \"oh and what've I got in the vault about… about Bylford?\", \"ok and what's the, er, the password on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0022\", \"v\": [[\"umm who's invited to the pick again?\", \"ok and, uh, apart from Otieno, who else is coming?\", \"oh hang on, quick one — can you show me my, um, my favourite photos?\", \"right, back to the pick — have I got a photo of any of them?\", \"ok different thing, what's on thursday?\", \"umm can you move the first one to monday and, uh, the third one to saturday?\"], [\"pick invitees?\", \"besides Otieno?\", \"wait — fave pics?\", \"back to the pick — photo of any of them?\", \"thursday?\", \"first to monday, third to saturday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0023\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much have I, like, spent in kabaddi fund so far?\", \"oh hang on, can you pull up the shots from, uh, February?\", \"ok going back to that — the first one, what are its expenses?\"], [\"kabaddi fund, how much spent?\", \"wait — February pics\", \"back to that — first one's expenses?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0024\", \"v\": [[\"We're meant to be reviewing the budget at the next meeting and I want to be prepared, so what have I actually spent on in kabaddi fund?\"], [\"umm so what've I been… what have I spent on in the kabaddi fund?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0025\", \"v\": [[\"Could you move the Rereth task to monday, please?\", \"Also, would you mind finding the label tasks for me?\", \"On a different note, could you please message Ryota the mobile account?\", \"One more thing — could you show me the subtasks of the insure the keystone this week task, please?\"], [\"umm can you shift the Rereth task to, uh, monday?\", \"ok and can you find my, um, label tasks?\", \"oh and, er, can you message Ryota the mobile account?\", \"ok so what are the subtasks on the, uh, insure the keystone this week task?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0026\", \"v\": [[\"Someone mentioned a Ryota at dinner last night and I couldn't place them at all — who is Ryota, according to my stuff?\", \"Ah, it's probably the Vravridge one I'm thinking of — what events are they coming to?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, it's someone's birthday soon — what do I have about Harriet?\", \"Ok, back to the other thing we were looking at — is there anything in my photos on them?\"], [\"who's Ryota\", \"the Vravridge one, what events r they coming to\", \"wait quick one, what do i have on Harriet\", \"ok back to the other one, anything in my photos on them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-0027\", \"v\": [[\"got any documents about kabaddi\", \"oh and can u push the koto club back a day\"], [\"kabaddi documents?\", \"koto club back a day\"]]}","ttft_ms":14603,"type":"result","duration_ms":32718,"uuid":"1f1d298c-0c3c-4621-bc7e-49537ad57070","ttft_stream_ms":1434,"time_to_request_ms":128,"first_content_frame_ms":1435,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21963069,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278513706.0674,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
